<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Precisely determine fault position" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Precisely determine fault position</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Gain a highly accurate and reliable fault location system. Monitor long cable runs, even in difficult-to-access areas. This allows you to pinpoint issues precisely, reducing diagnostic time and improving system uptime.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Save time by locating faults efficiently" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Save time by locating faults efficiently</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Save time locating faults, regardless of cable length. Quickly identify problem areas to minimize downtime and operational disruptions. Maintain continuous service and reduce repair costs.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify device installation and setup" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify device installation and setup</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Install the device simply without entering complex cable parameters. Only specify the cable length for quick setup. This streamlined process reduces installation time and effort for faster deployment and operational readiness.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='174vJwmvzxUD9agOFE