0high-voltage%20systems-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Apply SIPROTEC 7SE20 to overhead lines for high and extra high-voltage HVDC transmission. Use it for high-voltage lines in grounded and isolated systems and for sea cables. Monitor diverse critical infrastructure comprehensively.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/174vJwmvzxUD9agOFERW9y-en-US.json" page-id="1nG8f4Is8snSNCZxFcyzok" container="comp-174vJwmvzxUD9agOFERW9y"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='4oxwPzxCdgKlCqegTn3BEq' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_5' data-ste-section-id='4oxwPzxCdgKlCqegTn3BEq'>
